{{also|stipulé}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}}, from {{m|la|stipula||stalk (of hay), straw}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈstɪpjuːl/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|botany}} Basal appendage of a typical [[leaf]] of a flowering plant, usually appearing paired beside the [[petiole]] although sometimes absent or highly modified.

